<% elsif project %>
"<%= project.title %>" is approved<% if @actor %>, reviewed by @<%= @actor.display_name %><% end %>.
<% else %>
Your hardware funding request was approved.
<% end %>

Your project has moved to the build phase. Log your build hours with a timelapse, then ship when you're ready.
<% else %>
Your funding request needs changes

<% if project %>
